{
  "id": "glass_qasim_talk",
  "start": "greet",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "greet",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "A weighing house with the shutters half down against the glare, and a man setting brass weights on a beam by feel."
        },
        {
          "text": "“Salt is by the measure and the measure is on the wall. If you are arguing about the measure, argue outside.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "glass_qasim_nine",
          "text": "How many courses come out of these pans in a year?",
          "requires": {
            "without": {
              "lore": [
                "glass_courses_nine"
              ]
            }
          },
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "check": {
            "skill": "insight",
            "difficulty": {
              "sub": [
                13,
                {
                  "clamp": [
                    {
                      "div": [
                        {
                          "ref": "reputation.the_water_wardens",
                          "else": 0
                        },
                        5
                      ]
                    },
                    -6,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "onSuccess": "glass_qasim_nine_told",
            "onFailure": "glass_qasim_nine_wont"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "glass_qasim_taste",
          "text": "What is the ninth like?",
          "requires": {
            "without": {
              "lore": [
                "glass_courses_taste"
              ]
            }
          },
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "check": {
            "skill": "persuasion",
            "difficulty": {
              "sub": [
                15,
                {
                  "clamp": [
                    {
                      "div": [
                        {
                          "ref": "reputation.the_water_wardens",
                          "else": 0
                        },
                        5
                      ]
                    },
                    -6,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "onSuccess": "glass_qasim_taste_told",
            "onFailure": "glass_qasim_taste_wont"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "glass_qasim_jar",
          "text": "Let me take the jar.",
          "requires": {
            "without": {
              "items": [
                "weighers_jar"
              ],
              "flags": [
                {
                  "flag": "given:weighers_jar"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "check": {
            "skill": "persuasion",
            "difficulty": {
              "sub": [
                15,
                {
                  "clamp": [
                    {
                      "div": [
                        {
                          "ref": "reputation.the_water_wardens",
                          "else": 0
                        },
                        5
                      ]
                    },
                    -6,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "onSuccess": "glass_qasim_jar_gave",
            "onFailure": "glass_qasim_jar_kept"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "greet_leave",
          "text": "Nothing.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": [
        {
          "requires": {
            "factions": [
              {
                "faction": "the_water_wardens",
                "maxStanding": -30
              }
            ]
          },
          "goto": "glass_qasim_cold"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "glass_qasim_nine_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“Nine.” He does not look up from the beam. “Eight cut, nine weighed. Two hundred years of ledgers say nine and I have added every one of them twice.” He sets a weight. “Nobody has ever cut a ninth.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "glass_courses_nine"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "glass_qasim_nine_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "glass_qasim_nine_wont",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“I've said all I mean to,” they say, and go back to what they were doing."
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_water_wardens",
            "amount": -1
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "glass_qasim_nine_drop",
          "text": "Leave it.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "glass_qasim_taste_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "He goes and gets the jar without being asked, which tells you how long he has wanted to show somebody. “Heavier. And it does not taste of this sea — I have tasted this sea for forty years.” He stoppers it again. “I do not sell any of it.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "glass_courses_taste"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "glass_qasim_taste_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "glass_qasim_taste_wont",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“I've said all I mean to,” they say, and go back to what they were doing."
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_water_wardens",
            "amount": -1
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "glass_qasim_taste_drop",
          "text": "Leave it.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "glass_qasim_jar_gave",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "He hands it over with both hands and does not let go for a moment. “If you find out where it comes from, come back and tell me before you tell the wardens. Forty years is a long time to be the only one adding up.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "grantItem": {
            "target": {
              "ref": "actor.id"
            },
            "item": "weighers_jar",
            "quantity": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "setFlag": {
            "flag": "given:weighers_jar",
            "value": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "glass_qasim_jar_thanks",
          "text": "Thank you.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "glass_qasim_jar_kept",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“No.” He puts it back on the shelf, behind the counterweights. “It is the only evidence I have that I am not senile.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_water_wardens",
            "amount": -2
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "glass_qasim_jar_leave",
          "text": "Then no.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "glass_qasim_cold",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "He turns the beam away from you and waits, with the patience of a man who has all day and no intention of spending any of it on you."
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "glass_qasim_go",
          "text": "Leave it.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    }
  ]
}
